"p-3 font-mono opacity-70\">{it.slug}</td>\n                  <td className=\"p-3 font-mono opacity-70\">{it.size}</td>\n                </tr>\n              ))}\n            </React.Fragment>\n          ))}\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
